# Build-context ALLOWLIST for every image built from this repository.
# This working tree holds provider credentials (IBM / IQM / Open Quantum key and
# token files) whose names follow no single pattern, so the context starts empty
# and only the paths below are sent to the builder. Add a path only if an image
# COPYs it. Audit: docs/guides/DOCKER_QUICKSTART.md, "What goes into the images".
*

!docker/
!nifi_extensions/*.py
!tools/_harness.py
!tools/build_grover_examples.py
!tools/canvas_spacing.py
!tools/nifi_ready.py
!tools/quickstart_smoke.py
!tests/*.py
!demo/
!web/
!manage.py
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Never send these, even from inside an allowed directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*token*.txt
**/*token*.json
**/*key*.json
**/api_key*
**/*credential*
**/db.sqlite3
